name: ['Armadillo Cloak', 'Arrogant Wurm', 'Astral Slide', "Chainer's Edict", 'Circular Logic', 'Elves of Deep Shadow', 'Goblin Warchief', 'Lobotomy', 'Terminate', 'Wild Mongrel']
