text: ['Counter target spell unless its controller pays {1} for each card in your graveyard.\\nMadness {U} (If you discard this card, discard it into exile. When you do, cast it for its madness cost or put it into your graveyard.)', "Destroy target creature. It can't be regenerated.", 'Discard a card: Wild Mongrel gets +1/+1 and becomes the color of your choice until end of turn.', 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+2 and has trample.\\nWhenever enchanted creature deals damage, you gain that much life.', 'Goblin spells you cast cost {1} less to cast.\\nGoblins you control have haste.', "Target player reveals their hand, then you choose a card other than a basic land card from it. Search that player's graveyard, hand, and library for all cards with the same name as the chosen card and exile them. Then that player shuffles.", 'Target player sacrifices a creature.\\nFlashback {5}{B}{B} (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)', 'Trample\\nMadness {2}{G} (If you discard this card, discard it into exile. When you do, cast it for its madness cost or put it into your graveyard.)', "Whenever a player cycles a card, you may exile target creature. If you do, return that card to the battlefield under its owner's control at the beginning of the next end step.", '{T}: Add {B}. Elves of Deep Shadow deals 1 damage to you.']
flavor: ['"Don\'t laugh. It works."\\n—Yavimaya ranger', '"The hum of the universe is never off-key."\\n—Mystic elder', '"They are aberrations who have turned on everything we hold sacred. Let them be cast out."\\n—Ailheen, Speaker of the Council', 'It teaches *you* to play dead.', "It's hard to be humble when the whole world is bite size.", 'Like his mother before him, Darigaaz gave his life defending Dominaria from the tyranny of self-styled "gods."', 'The pits have their own form of mercy.', 'They poured from the Skirk Ridge like lava, burning and devouring everything in their path.']
artist: ['Anthony S. Waters', 'Ben Thompson', 'DiTerlizzi', 'Greg Hildebrandt & Tim Hildebrandt', 'Jesper Myrfors', 'John Avon', 'Paolo Parente', 'Ron Spears', 'Thomas M. Baxa']
